WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:06.430
A blue star, two gas planets, and a few anti-matter fuel plants.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.580
That's all that is.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:15.540
No citizens to rule over, no resources, and no pride.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.370
This is Baron Faibdacr Territory.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:27.080
A part of the Empire, though having little significance to it,

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:33.210
it lies alone as one of the many thousand solar systems trying to build their own respective histories.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.010
Calling from transfer shuttle of the patrol ship Gosroth.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.720
Attempting to reach traffic control for Baron Faibdacr Territory.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:43.490
Please respond.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:47.620
<i>This is Baron Faibdacr Territory control.</i>

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.490
I request a fuel re-supply.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.770
<i>A transfer shuttle from a patrol ship?</i>

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:54.930
<i>Roger.</i>

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.770
<i>Welcome, transfer shuttle of Gosroth.</i>

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.110
<i>Please indicate how you wish to receive the fuel.</i>

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:03.770
Since we are a light craft, we request supply at the dock.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:04.780
<i>Roger.</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.550
<i>Please indicate the volume of fuel.</i>

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.380
<i>Your Royal Highness!</i>

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.910
<i>They know her everywhere.</i>

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:16.890
Can you guide us to the dock?

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:20.390
<i>Of course, Your Highness! Right away!</i>

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.530
Baron Faibdacr Territory control...

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.900
...I must inform you about something.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.300
<i>We were...</i>

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:32.710
<i>...unaware of the demise of Gosroth.</i>

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.940
<i>That may have been...</i>

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.110
<i>...a fortunate thing for us.</i>

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:16.260
Saigezaitec Dafacra

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:16.260
Mysterious Conspiracy

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.420
How long will we be able to stay here?

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.790
I'd say 30 minutes.

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.050
That's it?!

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:33.190
We must get to Sfagnomr as soon as possible.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.530
I know that.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.570
But how far ahead are we from the enemy fleet?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.460
About 27 hours, in Sfagnomr time.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.800
In that case, can't we...

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.140
Forget I even mentioned it.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.950
I'm grateful that you haven't forgotten.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:09.090
Welcome to our territory, Your Royal Highness.

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:10.960
I will show you to your resting quarters.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.760
I'll have you do that, but...

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:17.060
I am presently a trainee pilot in the Laburec.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.270
I ask that you treat me as such.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:21.410
Yes, we understand.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.470
This way please, Your Royal Highness.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.380
Is it always like this?

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.610
Of course not!

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:50.030
You may be seated over there.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:52.640
Why is that?

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.640
That's because...

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.100
<i>I get it.</i>

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.880
<i>I guess to them I'm nothing more than a suspicious terran.</i>

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.110
Jinto! What are you waiting for. Come here!

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.860
What can I get you to drink?

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:21.540
Rather than a drink, I'd like to take a shower.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:22.700
Could you show me where it is?

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.440
We cannot allow a princess to bear the discomfort of a shower.

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:29.270
We will show you to our official bath hall.

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.040
Please give us a moment.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.280
I'm sorry, but we're in a hurry.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:36.350
And imperial family members take showers too, you know.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.220
Is that a fact?

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.690
I am not authorized to respond.

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.850
What can I get you to drink?

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:52.730
I'll have a surgu.

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:54.130
A nice cold one.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.130
I'll have a til nom.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.970
Hot, and with a slice of lope?

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.400
Lope in your til nom?

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:02.710
You've got a unique sense of taste.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:08.810
Very well.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:11.320
I shall bring you your til nom right away.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.790
Just one moment.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.690
I wonder if they'll bring me my surgu.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.610
Sernaic!

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:41.280
How could you?!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.080
I'm terribly sorry, Your Highness!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.680
What's the matter?

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:49.610
I spilt the drink that I just served Your Highness.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:54.650
I beg that you please accept my apology for my transgression.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.430
Your transgression? You mean this?

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.870
Goodness gracious!

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.740
Let me immediately wipe that for you.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.170
Don't bother.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:13.180
I don't know what your assumptions of us are...

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.410
...but I can wipe my own fingers.

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:17.480
I realize that, but...

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:18.610
Pardon me...

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:23.020
...but I think it would be rude to draw this out any further.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:25.920
Yes.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.500
I'm not comfortable with this environment.

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:35.230
Maybe I should forget about the shower.

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:39.300
<i>I'm sorry for not greeting you in person.</i>

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:42.470
<i>Your Highness Lafiel of the Crybh Royal Family.</i>

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:47.380
Yes, I am Ablïarsec néïc Dubreuscr Bœrh Parhynr Lafiel.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:52.550
<i>I'm Atosryac Ssynec Atosr Lymh Feubdach Clüarh</i>.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:54.420
<i>It's a pleasure to meet you.</i>

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.190
Nice to meet you, Baron.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:08:01.200
This is His Excellency, Linn Ssynec Rocr Ïarlucec Dreuc Haïder Jinto.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.430
Nice to meet you, Your Excellency.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:07.700
<i>The pleasure is mine, Your Excellency.</i>

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:09.970
<i>Your Highness...</i>

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.770
<i>...there is something I must apologize to you about.</i>

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:13.870
What is it?

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.870
<i>Well, it seems that we've messed up.</i>

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:20.510
<i>We've just realized that we lack the fuel you require.</i>

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:21.810
That's impossible.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.680
I confirmed it with our controller.

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.750
<i>I'm terribly sorry.</i>

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:29.660
<i>I've summoned a fuel asteroid.</i>

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.630
<i>It should be here soon.</i>

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:33.090
How long will it be?

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.560
<i>Shouldn't be more than twelve hours.</i>

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.860
Twelve hours?!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:44.630
<i>In the meantime, please sit back and enjoy my palace.</i>

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.540
Thank you, but we don't have time.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:51.070
I'm on duty right now.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:53.550
We'll fly out to meet the asteroid in our shuttle.

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:59.710
<i>I've been informed that your craft requires a major check.</i>

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:02.460
A check?

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:08.220
<i>Your Highness, please accept my sincere welcome.</i>

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:10.600
I've already explained our situation to your people.

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:14.730
I'm sure you've got other things to do than welcome us.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.540
Don't you need to consider an escape from your domain?

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:20.640
<i>I do appreciate your concern, however...</i>

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.980
<i>...we do not have a ship.</i>

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.280
<i>There are no means of escape.</i>

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.440
Is that so.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:27.180
However...

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:30.610
<i>Someone will show you around.</i>

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.280
<i>I'll see you at the dinner table.</i>

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:39.790
He was ignoring you as well.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:40.490
I noticed.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.490
I have a problem with that kind of attitude.

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:47.970
To welcome me properly, he should also be welcoming you.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:49.700
You're right.

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:51.840
But it can't be helped.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:55.440
You're a princess, and I'm some unknown nobleman.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.140
I don't like him.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:00.310
He seems to be deceiving us about the shuttle check.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:03.650
It's as if he's deliberately trying to hold us back.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:05.790
Why?

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:07.350
I don't know.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:11.390
Aren't you being a little too suspicious, Lafiel?

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:14.060
But I really don't like him!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:18.730
In that case...

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:21.500
...let's just think this through logically.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:24.510
Is there anyway he can benefit...

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.270
...by lying just to hold us back?

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:32.910
You don't look like you have any ideas.

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.740
How about this?

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.810
The baron is holding us so he can...

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:40.850
...steal our shuttle to get away from the enemy fleet.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.880
The shuttle has only two seats.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.650
Only two can go.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.160
It would be fine if the baron was planning to escape alone.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.860
And leave his vassals behind?

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:52.830
You don't trust the baron...

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:55.670
...but you trust his sense of righteousness?

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:56.500
You fool!

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.670
I'm not talking about personal ethics.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:02.510
There's nothing more shameful than deserting one's vassals.

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.170
The imperial laws against that are severe.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:08.820
Besides, getting caught with the additional crime...

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.450
...of stealing a shuttle would make him prefer a future...

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:12.950
...in a concentration camp under the United Mankind...

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:15.120
...than remain in the Empire.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:16.950
I see.

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:18.890
So, a title has its duty.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:21.290
Right. A title has its duty.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:25.630
So, you're saying the baron isn't planning any conspiracy.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.600
I guess you could say that.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.040
In that case, let him welcome you.

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:32.770
I'll also participate in what I can.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:40.840
Your Highness.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.780
Your bath is ready.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:45.150
Please follow me this way.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:48.160
The others will escort you, Your Excellency.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.450
I guess we can't take a bath together, huh?

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.630
Go ahead. We haven't got much time.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:11:59.970
You're right.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:01.240
Later.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:02.200
Yeah.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.270
Enjoy your bath.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.850
Let me wash your back for you.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:18.110
No.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.680
Let me wash your hair for you.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:21.450
No.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.360
Please. Do not hesitate to let me serve you.

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:27.420
I'm not hesitating at all.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.530
Are you all aware...

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:37.270
...that an enemy fleet is heading toward Sfagnomr?

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.170
Yes.

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:39.570
Aren't you afraid?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:43.100
No. I'm sure our master will take care of everything.

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.040
The baron?

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.740
How is he going to take care of things?

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.480
I'm not aware of how he'll manage things.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:53.350
The baron is certainly very well trusted.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:54.950
Of course he's well trusted.

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:57.250
If it wasn't for him...

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.630
...I would not be here today.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.330
What do you mean?

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:06.000
It has been a dream of mine to become an imperial citizen.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:06.760
However...

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:10.870
Where I grew up, the status of women is very low...

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:13.070
...and there's little hope for doing anything...

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:15.010
...other than being a wife and mother.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:17.140
I can't imagine it.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:21.080
My master saved me from that world...

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.450
...and even gave me an education.

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:24.680
Education?

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:26.010
Yes.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:29.860
I'm normally in charge of inspecting fueling equipment.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:32.330
I received education pertaining to that.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:34.760
Oh, so serving in the bath hall is not your main duty.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.820
No.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.770
In fact, this is my first time to serve in the bath hall.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.830
I've never been called upon to give the master a bath.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:46.730
Are the other's summoned to, say, wash the baron's back?

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:47.870
Yes.

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:49.940
lndeed...

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.750
...the master is a very kind person.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.240
He certainly doesn't look it.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:00.250
How many people are there in this domain?

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.620
I'd say about 50.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.890
How many of them are Abh?

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:08.020
There are two. The master and his father.

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.100
It seems to me like an awfully lonely life.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:14.300
It's true that it somewhat lacks excitement...

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:16.770
...but it's a completely worry-free lifestyle...

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:18.970
...so I have no complaints.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:22.310
So, I'm a convenient piece of entertainment.

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:23.840
Certainly not!

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:28.880
What the hell is this?

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.610
Are you telling me to wear this?

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.620
Those were the master's orders.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:37.130
Where did you put my uniform?

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.490
It is presently being washed.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.420
You treat your guests well.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:45.930
Also, military uniforms are said to be crude at the dinner table.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.760
Crude?!

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:50.370
But I only wear military uniforms!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.330
However...

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.670
Your Highness!

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:55.840
Please!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:57.980
Please!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.310
I'll wear the dress over the uniform.

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:04.980
That should be okay, right?

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:14.260
A warm welcome to you, Your Royal Highness.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.460
Where's Jinto?

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.130
Jinto?

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:21.900
Oh, you're talking about Count Haïder.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:24.700
My father is entertaining His Excellency.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.140
Why is your father not joining us for dinner?

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:29.410
My father doesn't enjoy company.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.000
You're contradicting yourself.

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:34.240
Why send a guest to your father if he prefers to be alone?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:37.150
Fellow sufferers pity one another, don't they?

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:39.350
What do you mean?

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:40.960
Never mind, please.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.250
I cannot ignore this.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.730
I have a responsibility to take Jinto...

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:49.030
...the count of Haïder to Sfagnomr.

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:51.100
Pardon me, Your Highness.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:56.000
You're not suspecting that we'd harm His Excellency, are you?

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.060
How can I not be suspicious?

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.470
That's regrettable.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.680
In any case, please sit down.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.710
Allow me to resolve these misunderstandings over dinner.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.220
I do hope they are misunderstandings.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:15.020
What kind of wine would you like with your meal?

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.720
I'm on duty.

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:18.520
I'd like something non-alcoholic.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.460
As you wish.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.730
How about some tule lashban?

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.470
By the way...

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:31.940
..I noticed that you address that young man by his name.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:35.070
Please feel free to do the same with me, and call me Clüarh.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.370
I refuse.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.250
Why is that?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.010
Because I don't want to call you that, Baron.

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:05.230
Please, go right ahead.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:12.240
It's delicious!

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.550
I'm honored, Your Highness.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.410
I wasn't complimenting you.

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.220
I was complimenting whoever prepared this.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:20.620
This was prepared by hand...

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.150
...not machines.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.320
Great insight, Your Highness.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:29.020
I'm not too fond of machines.

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:32.900
But I sense that you are upset about something,

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.830
Great insight, Baron.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:37.500
I'm very angry.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.300
Is it about that young terran?

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:41.900
Jinto is an Abh nobleman.

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:43.840
Yes, as I recall.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.610
It's not only about Jinto.

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:48.520
Are you sure the shuttle needs a check?

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:50.610
And you've got no shortage of fuel.

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:52.990
I'm doubting you on a number of issues.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:57.080
Oh, yes. I was lying about those things.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.060
We do have plenty of fuel...

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:01.830
...and we've no need to check the transfer shuttle.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.900
Then why did you lie?

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:09.360
You would not have joined me for dinner otherwise...

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:11.600
...no matter how I asked, Your Highness.

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.200
Of course not. We're in a hurry.

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:17.840
That proves that lying was my best option.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.780
Now that I know you're lying...

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.610
...you will let me leave, won't you?

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:25.140
Your Highness. Regarding your departure...

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:32.550
Would you be able to delay your departure a little?

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:33.620
How long?

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:36.560
Until the next ship from the Empire arrives.

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:40.830
In other words, until the safety of my domain is assured.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.600
We don't know when that would be.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.500
Exactly.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.830
So, you're trying to hold us up until then?

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:47.270
Yes.

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:56.050
What do you wish to gain from keeping us here?

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:57.780
Do you have some grudge against us?

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.790
Not at all.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:02.810
As long as you're here, Your Highness...

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:05.830
...I will do everything to make your stay enjoyable.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:09.900
I couldn't even think of doing anything to harm you.

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:11.060
Really.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:16.040
I'm no longer sure if you really understand what you're doing.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.700
Of course I understand.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:21.310
I am doing my best to protect my domain.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:24.740
What does confining us here have anything...

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:26.580
...to do with the safety of your domain?

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:30.350
Sfagnomr is a strong nation.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.980
The United Mankind no doubt see its strategic advantages.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:38.360
However, our baronial domain is small and with a short history.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:41.160
It is entirely possible that they have...

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.430
...never heard of the Baron Faibdacr Territory.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.190
What if...

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:50.330
...they detected your ship passing through the gates of Faibdacr?

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:54.440
They would become aware of a region they do not control...

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:56.570
...and perhaps proceed to conquer it.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:20:00.210
But we already passed through the gates of Faibdacr.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.710
How can you be sure that we weren't detected?

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.420
You may have been detected.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:08.910
One chance at the enemy detecting us is too much.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.960
It would be reckless to give the enemy a second chance.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:13.960
I follow your reasoning.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.960
So, therefore, Your Highness...

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.830
...I can understand your reluctance...

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:21.500
...but could you please remain here...

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:24.370
...until the enemy has left the vicinity?

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:28.570
You realize you're preventing me from carrying out a mission.

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:30.740
Aren't you worried...

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:33.750
...the Empire may appropriate the domain you're protecting?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.810
Not at all.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:39.380
I'm doing this out of passion for protecting my domain.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.750
The high court of the Empire will consider the actions proper.

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.120
Even if Sfagnomr...

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.750
...comes under attack before we have a chance to warn it?

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.990
That shouldn't be a problem either.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.690
There's a lot of traffic in that region.

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.100
If not yourself...

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:57.440
...someone is bound to warn them about the enemy fleet.

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:01.930
In which case, there should be nothing wrong with my actions.

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:05.310
I trust that you will testify to the courts that...

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:09.250
...I took good care of you while you were here, Your Highness.

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:11.280
In the name of the Abriel.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.280
How dare you bring up that name.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:20.290
Aside from myself...

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:22.350
...how is Jinto doing?

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:24.920
My father is looking after the Count of Haïder...

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:27.330
Stop with the nonsense, Baron.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:30.300
I hate being deceived.

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:32.300
I understand.

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:38.410
The young man doesn't deserve to be treated as a noble...

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.440
...and is being treated in a manner appropriate for a terran.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:43.820
How many times do I have to tell you...

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:45.510
...Jinto is a nobleman.

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:48.150
Also, I understand that you have a peculiar opinion...

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:50.560
...toward the rank of citizens.

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:54.490
I've never seen such servile citizens as your vassals.

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:57.290
They're like cats trained to do tricks.

00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:58.960
Unseemly.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:01.930
The relationship between a lord and his vassals...

00:22:01.970 --> 00:22:04.910
...is none of anyone else's business, even yours.

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:06.870
You're right.

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:10.770
I just wanted to know what you see as appropriate treatment...

00:22:10.810 --> 00:22:11.780
...for a terran.

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:16.220
It's nothing for you to worry about, Your Highness.

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:19.920
Another thing I noticed.

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:23.090
Are there no men among your vassals, Baron?

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:25.560
No.

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:29.760
I cannot stand having terran men around me.

00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:37.700
I now have yet another reason to dislike you.

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:44.270
<i>I hear that Abhs sometimes smile even in front...</i>

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:47.080
<i>...of those they hate.</i>

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:50.680
<i>"The smile of an Abh"...</i>

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:52.550
<i>So maligned that...</i>

00:22:52.590 --> 00:22:55.390
<i>...they say it's like a poisonous flower in its glory.</i>

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:58.280
<i>I have yet to see...</i>

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:02.290
<i>...Lafiel with such an expression.</i>

00:24:30.450 --> 00:24:32.150
He's being confined by the baron.

00:24:33.120 --> 00:24:36.290
Please take me to your son immediately!

00:24:36.460 --> 00:24:38.790
That would be impossible, young man.

00:24:38.830 --> 00:24:39.620
Why?

00:24:44.570 --> 00:24:45.660
Stay where you are!

00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:49.170
I will rescue Jinto even without your help.

00:24:50.770 --> 00:24:51.740
A hatch!

00:24:52.910 --> 00:24:55.310
It does not belong to the baron.

00:24:55.340 --> 00:24:56.940
It's a Laburec shuttle.

00:24:57.190 --> 00:24:59.980
Next episode

00:24:57.190 --> 00:24:59.980
Fortunate Revolt

00:24:57.190 --> 00:24:59.980
Raumechoth Raifa
